# Form 1040 line 25b: the 1099-G and 1099-MISC terms (difftest scaffold)

> Using Unemployment
> Using Form1099_misc

This scope exists for `make difftest SCOPE=line25b_1099g_misc` and as the
reference for the wiring that the orchestrator adds to `Form1040`. DF
`taxCalculations.xml /form1099Withholding` (line 25b) adds the 1099-INT, SSA,
1099-G, 1099-MISC and 1099-R withholding. `Form1040` receives the 1099-INT
part from `Interest` and everything else through its slot
`other_1099_withholding`; this module pair's share of that slot is the sum
below.

```catala
declaration scope Line25bFrom1099GAndMisc:
  input form_1099gs content list of Unemployment.Form1099G
  input form_1099miscs content list of Form1099_misc.Form1099Misc
  # The terms of line 25b that other modules compute (1099-INT, SSA, 1099-R).
  input other_terms content money
  g scope Unemployment.Unemployment
  m scope Form1099_misc.Form1099Miscs
  output form_1099_withholding content money

scope Line25bFrom1099GAndMisc:
  definition g.form_1099gs equals form_1099gs
  definition m.form_1099miscs equals form_1099miscs
  definition form_1099_withholding equals
    other_terms
    + g.form_1099g_federal_tax_withheld
    + m.form_1099_misc_federal_income_tax_withheld
```
